	(text "GP2 STROBE (via 6N137 + inverter)  GP3 RUN  GP4 HOME  GP6-9 MUX_EN0-3 (ADC option header J5)\nGP10 SCK / GP12 MISO / GP13 LD  -> 74HC165 chain (SPI1)\nGP16 OE / GP17 RCLK / GP18 SCK / GP19 MOSI -> 74HC595 chain (SPI0) via ISO7340C\nGP20 GP21 GP22 GP27 MUX_S0-3 (ADC option header J5)   GP26 ADC_IN (ADC option header J5)\nVSYS is tied to VBUS (USB-powered only; the module's own VBUS->VSYS diode is bypassed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
